# Runtime output — ignored by *location*, not by extension.
#
# A bare `*.jsonl` here made tests/captures/mastercard-probe.jsonl untracked, so a
# fresh clone had no capture: three test modules, examples/probe-a-capture.plexus.yaml,
# both first-run guides and the screenshot script all referenced a file that was not in
# the repository. Nothing caught it because the file exists on the machine that wrote it.
#
# A trace is output and belongs in logs/. A capture under tests/ is a fixture and is
# source. Extension cannot tell those apart; the path can.
logs/

# Local runtime pointers and secrets
.env
.env.local

# Editors
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Screenshot machinery: a relative-base build and a throwaway Chrome profile.
# The PNGs it produces are committed; the inputs are not.
ui/dist-docs/
ui/scripts/.chrome-screenshots/
